Do you want to know what plant is it? No problem! Plant Identifier App allows you to identify more than 12,000 plant species by photo, including: flowers, trees, leaves, bushes, shrubs, herbs and more from all over the world. Explore the plant world around you with the Plant Identifier App!

Your plant looks bad and you want to know what’s wrong with it? No problem! Plant Identifier App also allows you to identify more than 100 different plant diseases by photo, such as: pests, fungal disease, over-watered plant, thrips, powdery mildew, nutrient deficiency and more. Also app provides you information about the treatment of diseases.
 
APP CONTENT & MAIN FEATURES: 

• Plant Identifier 
Take a photo or select photo from gallery to identify more than 12,000 plant species, including: flowers, trees, leaves, shrubs, herbs and more from all over the world. We provide you information about the identified plant, such as: probability, common and scientific names, description, taxonomy, similar images and more.

 • Plant Disease Identifier 
Take a photo or select photo from gallery to identify more than 100 different plant diseases, such as: pests, fungal disease, over-watered plant and more. We provide you information about the identified plant disease, such as: probability, common and disease name, classification, cause, similar images, description, treatment and more.  

• Useful Articles 
Read more than 10 useful articles, such as: how to care of plants and more.

Note: For a more accurate plant or plant disease identification, please take or select high-quality photo so that the plant or plant disease is visible and is alone in the photo, avoid other plants in background.

Note that free version of the app is limited to:
– 1 Plant Identification;
– 1 Plant Disease Identification;
– 1 Article.
If you want to use the app without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”Plant Identifier Pro” is available.

 Auto-renewable Subscription ”Plant Identifier Pro” Info:
By subscribing you get premium (full, unlimited) access to all the features and content offered by Plant Identifier App.

Auto-renewable Subscription “Plant Identifier Pro” Includes:
– 90%+ Identification Accuracy;
– 12,000+ Plant Species;
– Unlock All Articles;
– Identify Plants Unlimited;
– Identify Plant Diseases Unlimited;

The app contains the following auto-renewable subscription called ”Plant Identifier Pro”:
– Weekly (2,99 US$) with a 3-days for free period.
* Subscription price may vary depending on your location;
* Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;
* Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;
* Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal;
* Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account;
* Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.

Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/plant-identifier-privacy/
Terms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/plant-identifier-terms/

Requested Access:
Photos – access to upload selected photos of plants or plant diseases for identification.
Camera – access to make photos of plants or plant diseases for identification.

Learning games for toddlers can help your little one learn through engaging sorting and matching activities. These games will immerse your child in the world of Bimi Boo and his friends, who live on an island and engage in various educational activities. Your child will play toddler games featuring various animals, including dogs, kittens, monkeys, birds, rabbits, and squirrels.
This learning game for kids provides an opportunity to spend time effectively and safely on an electronic device. The toddler app features simple games designed to develop fine motor skills, logic, memory, and entertain your child with bright colors, cute characters, and engaging tasks.
The toddler app includes the following educational games:
- Sorting items by color, shape, quantity, and size;
- Classifying objects using logic;
- Matching geometric shapes by silhouette;
- Sorting figures in the correct order;
- Reconstructing pictures from memory.
Designed for preschool kids, namely suitable for both boys and girls aged 2-5 years. All activities are developed with the participation of professionals in the field of children’s education and include educational elements such as puzzles, sorting, and logic games.
Encourage your toddler to explore, learn, and grow with Bimi Boo and friends by enjoying fun games. Let’s embark on this journey together, where all 30 learning games are available to play offline. Get started now and try out 3 toddler games for free!
